    "summary_one_sentence": "When an iconic cat-and-mouse chase leads into a museum, Tom and Jerry trigger an ancient magical compass that hurls them backward through time, forcing the rivals to team up to return home.",
    "summary_short": "During one of their chaotic indoor chases inside a museum, Tom and Jerry accidentally stumble upon and activate a mysterious ancient compass. The artifact's magical powers transport the duo to a distant historical era full of unfamiliar dangers and strange surroundings. To overcome the challenges of this ancient world and locate a way back to their own timeline, the legendary rivals must reluctantly set aside their feud and work as a team.",
    "summary_long": "The eternal rivalry between Tom and Jerry takes an unexpected turn during a high-energy chase through the halls of a local history museum. In the midst of the chaos, the pair accidentally disturb a rare artifact exhibit and unleash the hidden powers of an ancient magical compass. A sudden burst of mystical energy sweeps both cat and mouse into a temporal vortex, stranding them in an unfamiliar and distant era. Separated from everything they know, Tom and Jerry quickly discover that survival in this unknown land requires more than their usual slapstick antics. Dangerous terrain, unfamiliar creatures, and era-specific obstacles force the traditional enemies into an uneasy truce. As they navigate through historical landscapes, they must uncover the secrets of the magical compass to reactivate its portal-opening capabilities. Working together proves challenging as their natural instincts often clash, leading to comedic mishaps along the way. Ultimately, through a combination of Jerry's sharp wits and Tom's physical resilience, the duo learns to synchronize their efforts to overcome the period's ultimate trial. Their journey highlights a surprising depth of camaraderie as they race against time to power the device and return to the safety of their modern world.",
